{"id":"0cdf7f1474a3271f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-primitive-recursion.md","title":"部分函数的原始递归算子","display":"df-primitive-recursion — 部分函数的原始递归算子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-primitive-recursion","aliases":["20-df-primitive-recursion"],"display":"df-primitive-recursion — 部分函数的原始递归算子","chapter":"17","section":"17.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 17.2.1(iii)；部分函数版本的本地展开","source_pdf_pages":[256],"source_printed_pages":[229],"depends_on":["[[20-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-primitive-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-primitive-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursion — 部分函数的原始递归算子"},{"key":"chapter","html":"17"},{"key":"section","html":"17.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 17.2.1(iii)；部分函数版本的本地展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>256</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>229</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\">\\(g:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\omega^{k+2}\\rightharpoonup\\omega\">\\(h:\\omega^{k+2}\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(n,\\vec x)\\downarrow=z\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists u\\in\\omega^{n+1}\\ [g(\\vec x)\\downarrow=u_0\\land\n(\\forall i&lt;n\\ h(i,u_i,\\vec x)\\downarrow=u_{i+1})\\land z=u_n].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(n,\\vec x)\\downarrow=z\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists u\\in\\omega^{n+1}\\ [g(\\vec x)\\downarrow=u_0\\land\n(\\forall i&lt;n\\ h(i,u_i,\\vec x)\\downarrow=u_{i+1})\\land z=u_n].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限递归链存在时其每一项唯一，因此这是部分函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h\">\\(g,h\\)</span> 全定义时有限递归定理保证输出对全部输入存在。参数位置固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n,\\vec x)\">\\((n,\\vec x)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 17.2.1(iii)；部分函数版本的本地展开；印刷页 229；PDF 第 256 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\omega^{k+2}\\rightharpoonup\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(n,\\vec x)\\downarrow=z\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists u\\in\\omega^{n+1}\\ [g(\\vec x)\\downarrow=u_0\\land\n(\\forall i<n\\ h(i,u_i,\\vec x)\\downarrow=u_{i+1})\\land z=u_n].","display":true},{"tex":"g,h","display":false},{"tex":"(n,\\vec x)","display":false}],"bytes":1356,"backlinks":[{"id":"a197f5a4c2eb61dc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-primitive-recursive]]；see [[20-df-composition]]；see [[20-df-primitive-recursion]]。"},{"id":"cf6fbe6965e63f34","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-composition]]；see [[20-df-primitive-recursion]]。"}],"outgoing":["3f7915f8f8ad037c"]}